\ A wrong twin of as-one.lf (slice a2-iii; tests/front/tactics/apply/
\ wrong.lean): no hypothesis has the goal's type, and assumption fails
\ with Lean's message (error 381) and the goal.
\ Lean: theorem w_as (a b : Nat) (h : a ≤ b) : b ≤ a := by assumption
theorem w_as
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b
  a b ≤ explicit: h
  b a ≤
:= by
  by-assumption
end w_as
